SUMMARY:Sunset at Witton Barracks
DESCRIPTION:A relaxed community evening filled with great food\, live music
 \, local stalls\, and drinks as the sun sets over the historic Witton Barr
 acks. Delicious eats from local vendors\, browse unique market stalls\, fi
 re pits and drinks from the Good People bar bus. All proceeds go back to W
 itton barracks social enterprise and community hub. Lots of space to sit\,
  dogs welcome and a playground for the kids. Conveniently located next to 
 Indooroopilly Train Station. Perfect Friday evening catch-up with friends\
 , family\, and the local community (including our local Cr Penny Wolff).
LOCATION:Witton Barracks Park\, Indooroopilly\, Witton Barracks Park\, 9 La
 mbert Road\, Indooroopilly
